# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Heavy run artifacts — keep results (test_metrics.csv, config.yml, NOTES.md, run_config.json)
# but exclude multi-MB checkpoints, optimizer states, caches, and prediction dumps.
# (These caused git divergence/stash conflicts when committed.)
**/model_epoch*.pt
**/optimizer_state_epoch*.pt
**/test_results.p
**/train_data/
**/img_log/
**/output.log
runs/_*.log

# Generated feature pickles (regenerable from builders)
experiments/topology_ablation/features/*.p

# NH eval scratch dirs
**/_Lfullspan_eval/

# OS
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private working documents — kept LOCAL, deliberately untracked.
#
# The repo stays public, but the research log, strategy docs, and the paper
# are not published. These files still live in the working tree exactly where
# they always have; they are simply invisible to git. Edit them normally.
#
# Untracked on 2026-08-09 via `git rm --cached` (files were NOT deleted).
# Note: versions committed before that date remain in git history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

