/idea1.md
/updates.md
/current_implementation.md
/research_papers.md
/ml-conference-acceptance-criteria-report.md

# The paper: manuscript, figures, planning docs, and build output
paper/

# Local-only Claude skills (paper audit + review panel). .claude/commands/ stays tracked.
.claude/skills/

# Paper-review agent: will become its own repo (see review_agent/README.md)
/review_agent/

# Superseded work + pre-prune doc backups. Kept local for provenance, not published.
